index 835cfa3..c854f7d 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,32 @@
 
 All notable, unreleased changes to this project will be documented in this file. For the released changes, please visit the [Releases](https://github.com/saleor/saleor/releases) page.
 
+# 3.24.0
+
+### GraphQL API
+
+- Added age-restricted products. `Product.isAgeRestricted` (`Boolean!`) and `ProductInput.isAgeRestricted` (`productCreate`, `productUpdate`, `productBulkCreate`) mark products that customers must meet the shop's minimum age to buy. Passing `null` to `productUpdate` resets the flag to `false`.
+- Added the shop's minimum age and time zone: `Shop.ageRestrictionMinimumAge` (`Int!`, public), `ShopSettingsInput.ageRestrictionMinimumAge` (1 to 120, default 18), `Shop.timeZone` (`String!`) and `ShopSettingsInput.timeZone` (IANA name). `Shop.timeZone` requires `MANAGE_SETTINGS`.
+- Added customer birthdays: `User.birthday` (`Date`) and a `birthday` input on `accountRegister`, `accountUpdate`, `customerCreate`, `customerUpdate` and `customerBulkUpdate`. `accountRegister` accepts a birthday only from anonymous requests.
+- Added `User.isAgeEligible` (`Boolean`) and `User.isSuperuser` (`Boolean`). The birthday is returned only to the customer and superusers. `isAgeEligible` is also returned to staff with `MANAGE_USERS`.
+- Added `BIRTHDAY_CHANGED` and `BIRTHDAY_READ` to `CustomerEventsEnum`. Every birthday change, and every read of a birthday by someone other than the customer, is logged as a customer event.
+- Added the age restriction error codes `AGE_RESTRICTION_LOGIN_REQUIRED`, `AGE_RESTRICTION_BIRTHDAY_REQUIRED` and `AGE_RESTRICTION_UNDERAGE` to `CheckoutErrorCode`, `TransactionInitializeErrorCode`, `TransactionProcessErrorCode` and `CheckoutCreateFromOrderUnavailableVariantErrorCode`. `OrderCreateFromCheckoutErrorCode` gets `AGE_RESTRICTION_LOGIN_REQUIRED` and `AGE_RESTRICTION_NOT_ELIGIBLE`, and `OrderErrorCode` gets `AGE_RESTRICTION_NOT_ELIGIBLE`.
+- Restricted lines are checked when added or updated (`checkoutLinesAdd`, `checkoutLinesUpdate`, `checkoutCreate`, `checkoutCreateFromOrder`), when a checkout is completed (`checkoutComplete`, `transactionInitialize`, `transactionProcess`, `orderCreateFromCheckout`, automatic completion), and by the staff order mutations (`orderLinesCreate`, `draftOrderCreate`, `draftOrderComplete`). The completion check is the authority, so an earlier line check cannot be used to skip it. The transaction mutations return the error code on `lines` without the restricted variant ids.
+
+### Database migrations
+
+- `account` `0106_user_birthday` adds `account_user.birthday`.
+- `product` `0211_product_is_age_restricted` adds `product_product.is_age_restricted` (default `false`).
+- `site` `0053_sitesettings_age_restriction` adds `age_restriction_minimum_age` (default 18) and `time_zone` (default `UTC`) to the site settings.
+- All three migrations are additive and do not rewrite existing rows.
+- Rollback: reversing these migrations drops the new columns, so birthdays entered before the rollback are lost. Birthday customer events are not deleted.
+
+### Age restriction notes
+
+- Birthdays are self-declared and not verified. The age check is a shop-side gate, not identity verification.
+- Birthdays are visible only to the customer and superusers. Birthday events outlive the customer: when a customer is deleted, their `BIRTHDAY_CHANGED` and `BIRTHDAY_READ` events are kept without a link to the deleted user, and they still carry the customer and actor ids.
+- `orderBulkCreate` does not apply the age restriction. It imports historical or external orders for staff with the import permission, so restricted lines and customers without a birthday are accepted there. Checkout, transaction and draft order flows are checked.
+
